Sun Oct 18 05:34:01 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>

- Update to version 20260614:
  * Upstream moved off the dead sourceforge tree to a maintained
    rewrite (fuse3 and meson build system).
  * Fixes integer overflow (CVE-2015-8836) and buffer overflow
    (CVE-2015-8837), plus several other overflow and wrapping errors.
  * Fix iconv errors on non-glibc, infinite loop parsing line options
    on arm, symlink size reporting, fuse options placed before
    arguments, and block count calculation.
- Drop fuseiso-fuse3.patch: upstream ported to fuse3 natively and
  removed the autotools build the patch targeted.
- Port build to meson (%meson/%meson_build/%meson_install); drop
  libtool and autoreconf. Add versioned fuse3 >= 3.14 and
  glib-2.0 >= 2.2 floors from upstream meson.build.
- License re-verified as GPL-2.0-or-later from the source headers.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
